Kind loving love,
Kind loving love.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Submissiveness</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:45 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Submissiveness,
alien to the shining soul,
breathing union is.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>I surrender to the flow</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:44 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;I surrender to the flow…
Reaching the depth of my heart…
Union’s Embrace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Spring Energy</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:43 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Spring Energy,
Blessing our hearts with promising light.
Each blossom, a vow of harmony.
With gratitude, I honour your transience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Awakening Mind</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t17</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t17</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:42 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Awakening mind…
That which is conscious…
For the good of sentience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Present, mindful now</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t18</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:41 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Present, mindful now.
Peaceful heart, a quiet mind.
Harmony’s embrace.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Being is beyond knowledge</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t19</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:40 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Being is beyond knowledge,
being is integrity,
being is the totality.
The totality of your experiences,
The sacred energy that unites past and future to the present moment!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>To each cell</title>
    <link>https://river.yoso.one/#t20</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">on-river:river-t20</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:24:39 +0900</pubDate>
    <category>River</category>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hands in prayer,
I bow respectfully to each cell in my body,
and to the life in you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;From River.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  </item>
